{
  "kind": "flow-node",
  "version": 2,
  "tool": "skeleton",
  "meta": {
    "label": "Skeleton",
    "category": "Partition",
    "color": "#0891b2"
  },
  "description": "A pure CALCULATION node — compute the medial axis (raw skeletonization only): polygon in, skeleton out. Draws nothing on canvas.",
  "instructions": "A value-only node that does SKELETONIZATION ONLY — the raw medial-axis branches. Post-processing (prune spurs, longest branch, join to boundary) now lives in the Graph Reduce node: wire val-branches into a Graph Reduce.\n\nINPUT: `vertices` takes the outline as JSON [[x,y],...] metre pairs, local to the anchor. Wire Space Geometry's val-points into valin-vertices. A nested [[[x,y],...],...] list is accepted too — the LARGEST piece is used, since this node works on one polygon.\n\nOUTPUT: val-branches publishes the medial axis as a node/edge GRAPH JSON (wire into Graph Reduce / Mitered Join); val-polygons publishes the same axis as a nested list of line segments (a Polyline / Network node can draw it).\n\nEvery parameter is wireable (valin-*).",
  "handles": {
    "input": false,
    "output": false,
    "valueInputs": [
      {
        "key": "vertices",
        "label": "Vertices"
      },
      {
        "key": "type",
        "label": "Type"
      },
      {
        "key": "samples",
        "label": "Samples"
      },
      {
        "key": "level",
        "label": "Level"
      },
      {
        "key": "reduceLevel",
        "label": "Reduce segments"
      }
    ],
    "valueOutputs": [
      {
        "key": "branches",
        "label": "Branches (graph JSON)"
      },
      {
        "key": "polygons",
        "label": "Polygons (JSON)"
      },
      {
        "key": "polygonCount",
        "label": "Polygons"
      },
      {
        "key": "nodeCount",
        "label": "Nodes"
      },
      {
        "key": "edgeCount",
        "label": "Edges"
      }
    ]
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "key": "vertices",
      "label": "Vertices (JSON)",
      "kind": "text",
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "type",
      "label": "Type",
      "kind": "select",
      "default": "straight-skeleton",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "sampled-voronoi",
          "label": "Sampled Voronoi"
        },
        {
          "value": "segment-sweepline",
          "label": "Sweepline (segments)"
        },
        {
          "value": "straight-skeleton",
          "label": "Straight Skeleton"
        },
        {
          "value": "thinning",
          "label": "Thinning (rectilinear)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "samples",
      "label": "Samples",
      "kind": "range",
      "default": 8,
      "min": 2,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "showWhen": "type == 'sampled-voronoi' || type == 'segment-sweepline'"
    },
    {
      "key": "level",
      "label": "Level",
      "kind": "range",
      "default": 1,
      "min": 1,
      "max": 4,
      "step": 1,
      "showWhen": "type == 'straight-skeleton'"
    },
    {
      "key": "reduceLevel",
      "label": "Reduce segments",
      "kind": "range",
      "default": 0,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 5,
      "step": 1,
      "showWhen": "type == 'straight-skeleton'"
    }
  ]
}
